Incidentally, there is a work-in-progress piece of software that aim to=20
translate back and forth between Lojban and a custom logical notation ;=20
the project is called Tersmu: https://gitorious.org/tersmu/tersmu/

There's an interface to it on IRC, it's clearly not finished but is=20
already pretty good.

Here's a few samples of input-output:

=E2=80=A2 ro mlatu cu mabru
=C2=BB =E2=88=80x1:(mlatu(_)). mabru(x1)

=E2=80=A2 .e'a do xagji na gi'a citka su'o da
=C2=BB (xagji(do) =E2=86=92 =E2=88=83x1. citka(do,x1))

=E2=80=A2 na ku ro plise cu xunre
=C2=BB =C2=AC=E2=88=80x1:(plise(_)). xunre(x1)

=E2=80=A2 ro te cange poi ponse su'o xasli cu darxi ri
=C2=BB =E2=88=80x1:((cange( , ,_) =E2=88=A7 =E2=88=83x2:(xasli(_)). ponse(_=
,x2))). darxi(x1,{ri})


